    "Suppliers appear here as soon as you record a purchase from them." to mapOf("Türkçe" to "Bir tedarikçiden alım kaydettiğiniz anda burada görünür.", "English" to "Suppliers appear here as soon as you record a purchase from them.", "Deutsch" to "Lieferanten erscheinen hier, sobald Sie einen Einkauf bei ihnen erfassen.", "Français" to "Les fournisseurs apparaissent ici dès que vous enregistrez un achat auprès d'eux.", "Italiano" to "I fornitori compaiono qui appena registri un acquisto da loro.", "Español (Spanish)" to "Los proveedores aparecen aquí en cuanto registras una compra con ellos.", "Português" to "Os fornecedores aparecem aqui assim que registar uma compra com eles.", "Русский (Russian)" to "Поставщики появятся здесь, как только вы запишете закупку у них.", "日本語 (Japanese)" to "仕入先はその会社からの仕入を記録するとここに表示されます。", "中文 (Chinese)" to "当你记录了向某供应商的采购后，它就会出现在这里。", "العربية (Arabic)" to "يظهر الموردون هنا بمجرد تسجيل شراء منهم.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)" to "जैसे ही आप उनसे खरीद दर्ज करते हैं, आपूर्तिकर्ता यहाँ दिखने लगते हैं।"),
