    "customer-owned items are held here and deliberately valued at zero — they are the customer's property, not stock." to mapOf("Türkçe" to "müşteriye ait kalem burada tutuluyor ve bilerek sıfır değerleniyor — bunlar müşterinin malı, sizin stoğunuz değil.", "English" to "customer-owned items are held here and deliberately valued at zero — they are the customer's property, not stock.", "Deutsch" to "kundeneigene Artikel werden hier geführt und bewusst mit null bewertet — sie sind Eigentum des Kunden, kein Bestand.", "Français" to "articles appartenant au client sont conservés ici et volontairement valorisés à zéro — ce sont les biens du client, pas votre stock.", "Italiano" to "articoli di proprietà del cliente sono qui e valorizzati volutamente a zero — sono del cliente, non giacenza.", "Español (Spanish)" to "artículos propiedad del cliente se guardan aquí y se valoran a cero a propósito: son del cliente, no stock.", "Português" to "artigos pertencentes ao cliente estão aqui e são avaliados a zero de propósito — são do cliente, não stock.", "Русский (Russian)" to "позиций принадлежат клиенту и намеренно оценены в ноль — это собственность клиента, а не ваш запас.", "日本語 (Japanese)" to "件は顧客の所有物で、意図的に評価額ゼロとしています。あなたの在庫ではありません。", "中文 (Chinese)" to "件属于客户的物品保存在此，并有意计为零值——它们是客户的财产，不是你的库存。", "العربية (Arabic)" to "صنفاً مملوكاً للعميل محفوظ هنا ومقوَّم عمداً بصفر — فهي ملك العميل وليست مخزونك.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)" to "आइटम ग्राहक के हैं और जानबूझकर शून्य मूल्य पर रखे गए हैं — ये ग्राहक की संपत्ति हैं, आपका स्टॉक नहीं।"),
